sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant O as Order Service
    U->>W: Place order
    W->>A: Validate token
    A-->>W: OK
    W->>O: POST /orders
    alt in stock
        O-->>W: 201 Created
        W-->>U: Confirmation
    else out of stock
        O-->>W: 409 Conflict
        W-->>U: Show error
    end
    Note over W,O: All calls use mTLS
